                <div class="column">
                    <h4>Iconduck</h4>
                    <div class="divider-6"></div>
                    <p>
                        Iconduck is a project to make open source icons and
                        illustrations more accessible. We've started doing this
                        by collecting and tagging them, and making them
                        searchable.
                    </p>
